[gd_scene load_steps=46 format=3]

; Nursery set dressing. Contract (relied on by baby_room.gd and every activity
; scene): NO camera, NO UI, NO Area3D, nothing interactive, and exactly ONE
; DirectionalLight3D. The volume x[-0.8, 0.8] y[0, 1.0] z[-0.4, 0.8] around the
; origin is left clear for the baby, the bottle and the teddy.
;
; Furniture is the Kenney Furniture Kit (CC0). The kit is untextured, so
; `nursery_props.gd` retints every surface by material name onto the nursery
; palette at load. See that script for why.

